flowchart TD
    W[Write quorum W] --> R[Read quorum R]
    R --> CHECK{W + R > N?}
    CHECK -->|Yes| STRONG[Strong consistency likely]
    CHECK -->|No| EVENTUAL[Eventual consistency — stale reads possible]
    EX["Example N=3: W=2,R=2 strong | W=1,R=1 fast"]

    style STRONG fill:#d4edda,stroke:#28a745,color:#1a1a1a
    style EVENTUAL fill:#fff3cd,stroke:#ffc107,color:#1a1a1a
